01C1   21BA           00036 loopX   CALL    onems           ; Delay 1ms
Message[305]: Using default destination of 1 (file).
01C2   0BF1           00037                 DECFSZ  TimerX          ; Repeat X times 
01C3   29C1           00038                 GOTO    loopX           ; until Z
01C4   0008           00039                 RETURN                  ; and finish
