01CB   39F0           00055         ANDLW   0F0             ; Clear low nybble
01CC   0088           00056         MOVWF   PORTD           ; Output high nybble
01CD   18F4           00057         BTFSC   Select,RS       ; Test RS bit
01CE   1488           00058         BSF     PORTD,RS        ; and set for data
01CF   21C5           00059         CALL    pulseE          ; and clock display register
01D0   21BA           00060         CALL    onems           ; wait 1ms for display
                      00061 
Message[305]: Using default destination of 1 (file).
